Package: zackattack
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, ruby, libsqlite, pkg-config, build-essential
Section: security
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/urbanesec/ZackAttack
Description: NTLM authentication relaying toolkit
 ZackAttack is a toolset for relaying NTLM authentication, unveiled at
 DEF CON 20. Supports NTLMv2, custom rogue HTTP and SMB servers, relay
 to LDAP and Exchange Web Services, a SOCKS proxy, rule-based actions,
 and guided payloads to trigger auto-authentication.
 Note: the SMB (445) and HTTP (80) relay servers need root to bind
 privileged ports; the admin GUI and SOCKS proxy work without it.
